---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — VidMedical"
  description="VidMedical is a medical video studio making short explainer videos for health practices' social channels."
>
  <section class="bg-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-signal">About</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        A studio for medical social video — not a personal portfolio with a logo taped on.
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <p>
          VidMedical makes short medical and health explainer videos for practices that need steady
          social content with clinical sense — procedures, biomechanics, treatment education, and
          clear patient-facing explainers.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work After Effects–first for animated explainers, and we polish clinician-on-camera
          footage when that’s the right format. The point is substance that earns trust on a phone
          screen — not generic “clinic vibes” montages.
        </p>
        <p>
          Production is email-led and productized so retainers stay predictable. As volume grows,
          the studio scales with systems and junior editors under clinical-creative QA — the brand
          is the studio, not a single face on every page.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 border-t border-ink/10 pt-12 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Clinically informed</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Medical communication literacy in the process — accuracy and clarity before trends.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Built for social</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Vertical, caption-ready, paced for Reels and Shorts — deliverables you can post.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-ink">Studio systems</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Templates, revision limits, and monthly billing rhythm designed to scale without chaos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
